# Local refactor working notes (M series): the maintenance refactor is
# tracked in root TODO.md / REFACTOR.md, which are working files NOT
# version-controlled. Historical P/R-series archives stay tracked under
# docs/archive/ (root-anchored so only the working files are ignored).
/TODO.md
/REFACTOR.md

# AppImage debug extraction: `--appimage-extract` unpacks next to the
# .AppImage and lands in `./squashfs-root/`. That's local scratch (271 MB
# on the linux/amd64 image), not a repo input — ignore it everywhere so
# `git status` doesn't show it as untracked after a one-off `extract` for
# debugging the AppImage's bundled binaries.
/squashfs-root/
**/squashfs-root/
